3","global_turn_index":89,"locator":"[S5T3]","raw_turn_sha256":"4e8629a280d0668f0b21d809cc632ec45eaa210329c124b72deade34373bad4f","rendered_turn_sha256":"a25cd32818a9be4a8398a4723f9944448d406631a9818161bf7b4c014fd2adec","session_date":"2023-05-03","session_datetime":"2023-05-03T13:16:00","session_id":"session_5","session_index":5,"source_sha256":"f780fc81b2633d459e3ab3d4e0de59b1ef46f681a5bda018947e234d67eeec22","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":3}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Dave: Hey Calvin! Long time no talk. How's it going? Crazy news - I'm teaming up with a local garage. Take a look at what we working on together!\n[Image caption: a photo of a car being worked on in a garage]\n[S5T1] (dia_id: D5:1)\n\nCalvin: Hey Dave, great to hear from you! That's awesome news about teaming up with a local garage. Super inspiring seeing you follow your passion. Congratulations on this new venture. It's impressive how far you've come since we last chatted. How's everything going?\n[Image caption: a photo of a green car in a garage with a sign in the background]\n[S5T2] (dia_id: D5:2)\n\nDave: Thanks, Calvin! I'm loving this job. I get to work with awesome mechanics and share my knowledge about cars. Here's what I'm currently working on! It's a cool project, even if it's a bit challenging. 🤩\n[Image caption: a photography of a man working on a car engine in a garage]\n[S5T3] (dia_id: D5:3)","text_sha256":"fe575d1e648b8196ba1a6bffaf720baecb9e4602ddc3d327136fb46ba3bd885e","timestamp":"2023-05-03T13:16:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D6:8"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":35,"line_start":34,"source_locators":["[S6T8]"],"text_sha256":"703ec4ef77edcf6b004fa72c797a33a6bf5f2b68641fb708663c2b5ff2319396"},{"dia_ids":["D6:9"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":38,"line_start":37,"source_locators":["[